# 0.1 (`RULE-POSITION-ENUMERATION`): RULE 2.4's enum half. Stripping the quotes is a pure
# spelling change — the value inside them was already the value the engine
# used, so the model and the drawing are identical before and after.
figdown "0.1" block
flow "down"
node a "A" shape="box"
node b "B" style="dashed"
edge a -> b style="dotted"
